    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee Saulo gaasadá' gari sa qwalalaá/.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baldá' gusisíngw úr oo múk kríshaanáy iri iimu/ún baraá Yerusalemuro, sleémeero tari diyaa/aát baraá yaamaá Yudearo nee Samariaro, ala aqo har ya/abuuse kilós ina mét. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Munguú ilaiwawaá/ Stefano guri foól, kuri sa tsuunqumiís ló'wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Saulo múk kríshaanáy guri gusiisín. Iri daráh baraá umuúqo do'o, hhawaate nee /ameenaaro giri duuruxún, giri dahamiís baraá doó tseegamo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala eeharuuseedá' aa diyaa/at iri tleér umuúqo amooro, Ya/abtór hho' kari alki/iít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Filipo iri aweér ay baraá gixsár Samaria, kángw Kristo guri alki/iít dír múk i alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Filipo axweesantá Mungú ngiwa alki/iít nee layu ngiwa tlehhiít, boo/oó muu axweesanayduú Filipo kuri ló'wa slaá' iiárií qamingo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma múk yaariír neetlaame aa eér, neetlaameedá' iri /aa/amiín ar afór ur, iri ti'imít. Nee múk yaariír oo tiqtír sol'omit nee taqooraay kuri hungu/umiís sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk gixsadá' qwal/uú yaariír guri sláy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heeko umuuwós ta bay Simon i deer baraá gixsadae. Inós a qwaslaarmo. Múk yaariír baraá gixsár Samariaro tana ló'wa waa/oó/, asma inós i kaahi, «Aníng a heé úr.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heewí kuna slaá' kuwa iiárií qamin nee muu sleémeero, iimír na/áy wa tleemu ay heé úr, ta kaahi, «Heewí an aleesleemuuduú Mungú, kudá' ta bay aleesleemuudá' úr.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heewí kun iiárií qamín asma de'emaá yaariire waa/oo/amo gana tlehhiít ar qwaslaari'iimarós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala daxta mukdaádá' axweesantá Filipo gari haratlintií', daanduú Ya/abtór hho' ar Mungú nee Yesu Kristo, hhawaate nee /ameenaaro kiri baatimiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni inósuú kilá' sleeme iri haratlintií', kuri baatiís, tiri alkoomakoné' nee Filipo. Slám iri waa/oo/amín qoomár layu nee muruú waa/oo/amo kudá' Filipo aa tlehhiít ngiwa ár.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya/abuuseedá' Yerusalemúr i dirii' gari axás adór múk Samaria axweesantá Mungú ngira ilaaóh. Petro nee Yohane kiri amoodií ya/aáw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya/abuuseedá' tsár iwa amoodií hardát, mukdá' aa haratlintii' kuri aleefirín as Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú kuwa ilaaoohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma tam heé wák oo Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú gwa ilaaoh i kaahh, aqo kina tawó baatimiís ar umuú Aako Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petro nee Yohane daber'ín kari qaás gawaaín i alé, nee Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú kuri ilaaóh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Símonuduú qwaslaarmo adoodá' ngiwa ár, adór muu Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú ngur slasláy ar dabér ya/abuuse, peésa gari haniisár wa slaá', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iri oó', «Aleesleemuuwí aníng i haniisare' sleeme, as daqaní umuúqo heewo oo aníng ni dákwií qaas, masók Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú gu sláy.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Petro iri oó', «Kuúng nee peésaroge, tsarere'eét, asma kuúng kawa xu', qeemuú Mungú ku slasláy ar peésa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinku'uumár kuúng nee atén i káhh gawaá kaangwihe, asma muunaáwók ku hhoohhooeeká dír geeraá Munguhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe tlakweemaawók kwisingá' hhu'u'umeek, Aako na firiimeek, doóqa inslawaysuú baraá muunaáwók gu gurtláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma án kuúng u ga/áw, da/tá baraá guruuwók i qarqát adór saaxí. Slám kuúng tlakweema ugwa oohiyé'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
